MvSGluZGkvMjAyNi9MaW5nYW0lMjAlMjgyMDI2JTI5Lw.1.5","title":"The Season of Betrayal","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2026-06-26T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Lingam marries Ponmalar, hoping to finally build a peaceful life. But a conspiracy unfolds involving poisoned liquor. Enraged, Lingam begins hunting down those responsible.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/x52rYoZFkxYH0qriOpb1J8mc1JE.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNi9MaW5nYW0lMjAlMjgyMDI2JTI5Lw.1.6","title":"The Chill of a Mild Tremor","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2026-06-26T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Driven by revenge for Chellapandian's death, Lingam hunts down Samiyappan. While helping a young couple, he finds himself in a crisis and is compelled to go into hiding.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tccZl4AFCzfuHQxVukhcix1mYCp.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNi9MaW5nYW0lMjAlMjgyMDI2JTI5Lw.1.7","title":"The Breaking Palm Tree","season":1,"episode":7,"released":"2026-06-26T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Lingam rises as the undisputed kingpin of Kanyakumari. As his friendship with Thiru deteriorates, Lingam discovers the puppeteer pulling Chellapandian and Samiyappan's strings.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/APycZURUuqZqeMazYRyLqZsCEx.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNi9MaW5nYW0lMjAlMjgyMDI2JTI5Lw.1.8","title":"The Burning Sea","season":1,"episode":8,"released":"2026-06-26T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Devastated by Bhaskar's death, Lingam swears revenge against Chelladurai, adding to his mother's misery. Lingam gives Chelladurai 30 days to prepare for the consequences.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/v6zePvpswNXgq1hEYv6wkDUv88L.jpg"}]}}